== Spotify artist link template ==

This template creates a link to a Spotify artist page with the Spotify logo.

=== Usage ===
<pre>
{{Spotify artist
|1= <!-- Spotify artist ID (required) -->
|2= <!-- Description (optional) -->
}}
</pre>

=== Parameters ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Type !! Required
|-
| 1 || Spotify artist ID || String || Yes
|-
| 2 || Description || String || No
|}

=== Examples ===
==== With description ====
<pre>
{{Spotify|5WbJGPIGG5oCaVgMsfXZgu|天月}}
</pre>
Result: 
{{Spotify|5WbJGPIGG5oCaVgMsfXZgu|天月}}

==== Without description ====
<pre>
{{Spotify|5WbJGPIGG5oCaVgMsfXZgu}}
</pre>
Result: 
{{Spotify|5WbJGPIGG5oCaVgMsfXZgu}}

